  "body": "Only one year young and meticulously maintained by its owners, this beautifully presented home is in near new condition. Offering four generous bedrooms, three modern bathrooms and two separate living areas, it perfectly combines style, comfort and practicality.\r\nGround Floor Features:\r\n•Spacious entranceway with thoughtfully designed LED feature lighting, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere.\r\n•Separate lounge with seamless indoor outdoor flow to the deck, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.\r\n•Two generously sized bedrooms sharing a modern bathroom with underfloor heating.\r\n•Double internal-access garage, dedicated laundry and practical under stair storage.\r\nUpper Floor Features\r\n•Expansive open plan living and dining area featuring oversized windows that capture stunning views and abundant natural light.\r\n•Stylish, contemporary kitchen with quality finishes, seamlessly connecting to the dining area.\r\n•Two spacious bedrooms, including a master suite with walk in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\n•Generous family bathroom featuring a bathtub, with underfloor heating in both upstairs bathrooms.\r\n•Central air conditioning throughout the home for year round comfort.\r\nSuperb Location \r\n•Spacious front yard with beautiful surroundings and stunning outlook.\r\n•Zoned for Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College.\r\n•Moments from Pak'nSave, Highland Park Library, banks, cafes and restaurants.\r\n•Easy access to Botany Town Centre, Lloyd Elsmore Park, swimming pools and leisure facilities.\r\nWhy wait to build? This beautifully maintained, near-new home offers modern comfort, flexible family living and stunning views, all ready for you to move in and enjoy! Contact us today to arrange a viewing!",
